        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 170-32-600, 32\" Heavy Duty Bumper Guard</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged  completed with one (1) 32\" x 8\" Bumper Guard, one (1) Back Plate,  one (1) Mounting Plate plus six (6) 5/16-18 thru-bolts and nuts (bolt length for standard for 1-3/4\" thick door).  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe door Bumper Guard is heavy duty .125\" thick spring steel (ANSI K87434). The included back plate protects the face of the door from wear caused by sliding motion of the Bumper Guard. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUsed to protect commercial doors such as warehouses and factory doors that are run into with carts and forklifts. Also used on hospitals doors to protect against gurneys (gurney door guards). For use on wood and metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCan be install on one side of a single acting door or back to back on double acting doors (door swings in both directions). Note: <b>Back to back</b> installation requires <b>Two (2) Bumpers</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/bommer-170-32-600-size.gif?v=1704442270\" width=\"540\" height=\"330\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer 170-32-600 Door Bumper Guard Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> for the Bommer 170-32-600 Door Bumper Guard:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: .125\" Spring Steel (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Prime Coat</b></li>\r\n<li>Bumper Guard Length: 32\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Guard Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Guard Projection: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws with Nuts: 5/16-18</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/170-T.pdf?v=1691094993\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 170 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Dscontinued. </b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
